[[Burawa]] shares a land border with 9 countries: [[Kijura]], [[Jamia]], [[Faheya]], [[West Dakare]], [[Dakare]], [[Kwalib]], [[Kushish]], [[Maianka]] and [[Sabia]]. The land borders, counterclockwise from east to west are the [[Burawa-Sabia Border]], [[Burawa-Maianka border]], the [[Burawa-Kushish border]], the [[Burawa-Kwalib border]], the [[Burawa-Dakare border]], the [[Burawa-West Dakare border]], the [[Burawa-Faheya border]], the [[Burawa-Jamia border]], [[Burawa-Naipia vorder]], the [[Burawa-Kijura border]]. To the south, Burawa shares a maritime border with [[Volisania]] and [[Reige]].